summary:
  An address stays in the map after its station left the list.

history:
  An address can carry a listener's token. Removed from the list, it is not
  to be found in the config a month later.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return _text(_entries(text).filter(function(e) { return held[e[0]] === true; }));

replace:
      return _text(_entries(text).filter(function(e) { return held[e[0]] !== false; }));

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_only_addresses_still_saved_stay_in_the_map.
  Line-neutral.
